Libre Computer Wiring Tool — license notice
==========================================

This project is REUSE-compliant (https://reuse.software/).  Every covered
source file carries an SPDX license tag (or is covered by REUSE.toml).
Full license texts live in LICENSES/ (SPDX License List identifiers).

Summary of licenses used in project-authored files:

  Overlay device-tree sources (libre-computer/*/dt/*.dts)
      SPDX: (GPL-2.0-or-later OR MIT)

  Tools and build system (ldto, lgpio, Makefile, scripts/, test/, debian/
  packaging helpers, vendor board helpers)
      SPDX: GPL-2.0-only

  Board maps and config/deps data (*.map, dt.config, gpio.config, dt.deps)
      SPDX: MIT

  This notice file, debian/copyright, REUSE.toml
      SPDX: CC0-1.0

Vendored Linux kernel UAPI headers under include/dt-bindings/ keep their
upstream license intent, expressed with modern SPDX identifiers
(GPL-2.0-only, dual GPL/MIT, GPL OR BSD-3-Clause, etc.).

SBOM export (SPDX tag-value document):

  make sbom                 # writes sbom.spdx (requires `reuse`)
  # or:  reuse spdx -o sbom.spdx

Verify REUSE compliance:

  make reuse-lint           # requires `reuse` (pipx install reuse)

Debian packaging machine-readable copyright: debian/copyright
SPDX License List: https://spdx.org/licenses/
